    "build_the_bowl": {
      "type": "multicolumn-with-icons",
      "blocks": {
        "part_rice": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "box",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "heading": "1. Coconut jasmine rice",
            "text": "<p>Jasmine rice simmered in ½ cup full-fat canned coconut milk plus 1 cup water. It is the creamy, faintly sweet base that absorbs the glaze and tempers the heat.</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "part_salmon": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "lightning",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "heading": "2. Hot honey salmon",
            "text": "<p>Equal parts Dijon, honey, and sriracha, brushed on and rested 30 minutes so it actually sticks. Sesame seeds toast into a crust while the honey caramelizes.</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "part_salsa": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "organic",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "heading": "3. Mango salsa",
            "text": "<p>Mango, red bell pepper, red onion, tomato, cilantro, and lime. This is the acid — it cuts the honey and is the difference between a balanced bowl and a heavy one.</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "part_crunch": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "star",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "heading": "4. Crunch and cool",
            "text": "<p>Shelled edamame, thin-sliced Persian cucumber, and a hard squeeze of lime. Cheap, fast, and the reason the bowl stays refreshing all the way to the last bite.</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "part_rice",
        "part_salmon",
        "part_salsa",
        "part_crunch"
      ],
