        "description": "<p>Developed with Seatopia Atlantic Salmon — 6 oz skin-off, sushi-grade portions that bake in 10–12 minutes straight from an overnight thaw. King Salmon and Alpine King work beautifully under the same glaze, and a <a href=\"/products/digital-thermometer\" title=\"Digital Thermometer\">digital thermometer</a> takes the last bit of guesswork out of it.</p>",
