          }
        },
        "mp_text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Coconut rice keeps 4 days refrigerated. The glaze can be whisked and stored for a week. The salsa is best on days one and two, and the salmon is genuinely good cold — this is a bowl we eat straight out of the fridge at 2pm without reheating anything.</p><p>Our rhythm: thaw Sunday morning, cook a double batch of rice and salmon Sunday afternoon, chop fresh salsa midweek. About an hour of work for four lunches.</p>",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_font": "body",
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
