        "text_standard": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Every Seatopia product ships with a Certificate of Analysis. The Atlantic Salmon in this recipe is third-party lab tested to be mercury-safe (≤ 0.1 ppm) with zero detectable microplastics in the samples tested — and each 6 oz portion delivers roughly 1,960 mg of marine omega-3s (about 709 mg EPA and 1,254 mg DHA) plus around 28 mcg of selenium. That is the <a href=\"/pages/seatopia-testing-commitment\" title=\"Seatopia's Testing Commitment\">Seatopia Standard</a>, and it is why we are comfortable telling you to put this bowl on repeat.</p>",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_font": "body",
            "secondary_color": false,
